<title>UK: Quintain sells London site for 10.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Quintain sells London site for 10.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quintain Estates &amp; Developments Plc has exchanged contracts on the sale of a freehold site in West London to Sears Property Development Company Ltd for 10.5 million stg in cash, Quintain said on Monday.</p>
<p>The site was acquired by Quintain for 6.1 million stg in March of last year. At the time of purchase the site produced annual rental income of 150,000 stg but this has since risen to 723,000.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
